out groper "\n\rWelcome to Charm.  Please don't feed the mobiles!\n\rOn the Concourse\n\r  The concourse continues its path around the city.  The southern gates of the\n\rcity are west of here, and park road lies north.  The northeastern corner of\n\rthe city wall is east.\n\rDelver the Recruit is here.\n\r\nNum          Name Unread Description\n\r==== ============ ====== =============================\n\r( 1)      General [   0] General discussion\n\r( 2)        Ideas [   0] Suggestion for improvement\n\r( 3)     Announce [   0] Announcements from Immortals\n\r( 4)         Bugs [   0] Typos, bugs, errors\n\r( 5)     Personal [   0] Personal messages\n\r\n\rYou current board is General.\n\rYou can both read and write on this board.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 9 "@mob 3011 3129"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 10 "@as delver"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 11 "look"
out delver "On the Concourse\n\r  The concourse continues its path around the city.  The southern gates of the\n\rcity are west of here, and park road lies north.  The northeastern corner of\n\rthe city wall is east.\n\rHassan is here, waiting to dispense some justice.\n\rGroper the Recruit is here.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 12 "look hassan"
out delver "Big. Very big.\n\rStupid. Very stupid.\n\r\n\rHassan, the guardian of  the Temple of Mota, towers over you.  He's over 12 \n\rfeet tall, every inch of it muscle. It would be a Bad Thing to commit a crime\n\rin his presence.\n\rHassan is in excellent condition.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
out groper "\n\rDelver looks at Hassan.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
